                                                "sense_id": "f40db01d-9216-3091-8837-b6bfeba16176",
                                                "text": "I looked around. Ari in a green jacket with four inches of fore arm showing and trousers at half mast, Penny and I in mismatched padded jackets and ski trousers which were way too long; and all wearing the silver moon boots that had been the rage in the early eighties."
